# Definition of Done (BeerMe)

A ticket is **not Done** until:

## All changes

- [ ] Scoped to linked GitHub issue `#`; no scope creep
- [ ] Owning zone respected (Orion / Engine / Voyager) or handoff noted
- [ ] `PYTHONPATH=. pytest -q` green for touched areas
- [ ] `/security-secrets-check` clean on diff
- [ ] PR references issue; merged → issue on board **Done**

## Engine / catalog

- [ ] No invented beers in recommender output
- [ ] Confidence logic remains in `taste_profile.py`, not LLM or UI

## LLM

- [ ] Parse/retry tested with fixtures where applicable
- [ ] No live Ollama required for unit tests of engine logic

## Phase close (Phase 7)

- [ ] `bash scripts/qa/beerme-smoke.sh` HITL issue Done
- [ ] `/release-readiness` checklist in `docs/cursor-teams/RELEASE_GATES.md`
- [ ] PRD version/changelog updated if phase scope changed
